1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,109
Now let forty years go by.

2
00:00:02,109 --> 00:00:03,763
Watch the sal trunk.

3
00:00:03,763 --> 00:00:09,257
Every year it gets thicker, until it is wider than your arms can reach around.

4
00:00:09,257 --> 00:00:10,364
And the bamboo?

5
00:00:10,364 --> 00:00:15,820
It came out of the ground as wide as it would ever be, and it never gets any thicker.

